@startuml
title Maturity semantic evaluation - initial target and future enrichment
rectangle "Original selections and provenance\nimplemented capture" as evidence
rectangle "Evidence acquisition and projection\nsaved Maturity sessions" as projection
rectangle "Role Profile Builder and profiles\nfuture, not prerequisite" as profiles
rectangle "Current consolidated BF01 definition\nand repository" as rules
rectangle "Core and contribution evaluation\nBF01 pilot; relationships pending" as match
rectangle "Pattern aggregation\nfuture" as aggregate
rectangle "Diagnostic candidate" as candidate
rectangle "Evidence sufficiency and eligibility\nBF01 provisional policy" as support
rectangle "Diagnostic finding\nBF01 provisional narrative" as finding
rectangle "Trace: provenance,\nstates and reasons" as trace
rectangle "Diagnostics Console\nBF01 in-memory trace" as console
package "Modular storage (files exist; loading is future)" {
  rectangle "catalogue.json\nRule ID -> Pattern ID, status, version, paths" as catalogue
  rectangle "Catalogue-driven loader\nfuture" as loader
  rectangle "Rule ID/core.json\ntrigger definition" as coreFile
  rectangle "Rule ID/supporting.json\nevidence and context" as supportFile
  rectangle "Rule ID/interpretation.json\nnarrative and guardrails" as interpretationFile
}
evidence --> projection
evidence ..> profiles : future
profiles ..> projection : future profile interpretations
projection --> match
rules --> match
match ..> aggregate : future multi-rule aggregation
aggregate --> support
projection --> support
match --> candidate : matched BF01 relationship
aggregate ..> candidate : future
candidate --> support
support --> finding : only when eligible
projection ..> trace
match ..> trace
aggregate ..> trace
support ..> trace
trace --> console : BF01 run
catalogue ..> loader : resolve Rule ID
loader ..> coreFile : future
loader ..> supportFile : future
loader ..> interpretationFile : future
coreFile ..> match : future trigger evaluation
supportFile ..> support : future evidence assessment
interpretationFile ..> finding : future composition
catalogue ..> aggregate : multiple Rule IDs per Pattern ID
note bottom of match
  Initial evaluation uses original selected behaviours.
  A trigger is a candidate, not an automatic insight.
  Numeric flow rules use a distinct strategy and schema.
end note
note bottom of catalogue
  All modular entries are proposed.
  The current BF01 pilot still loads
  the retained consolidated source and narrative.
end note
note bottom of profiles
  Future dedicated user experience and interpreted
  evidence for each role; original evidence remains
  authoritative and accessible. No profile implementation now.
end note
@enduml
